     "titulo": "Numerals and agreement",
     "texto": [
      "**Dwa** goes with masculine and neuter nouns; **dwie** with feminine nouns: **dwa bilety**, **dwie osoby**.",
      "In age expressions one says **dwa lata**, also when talking about a girl. With five or more, many nouns take the genitive plural."
     ],
